2. Map tiles
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

By default the web app loads map tiles from the OpenStreetMap tile servers (tile.openstreetmap.org) and shows the
attribution "© OpenStreetMap contributors" with a link to https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright.
  Map data:     © OpenStreetMap contributors, Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.
  Tile use:     subject to the OpenStreetMap Foundation Tile Usage Policy
                (https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/tiles/). A public deployment with real traffic
                should use its own or a commercial tile service (SMARTAGRI_TILE_URL) and set the matching
                attribution (SMARTAGRI_TILE_ATTRIBUTION). SMARTAGRI_TILE_URL=none turns tiles off.
No tiles are stored in this repository.

